OL,3,GNEWSADad fined after son, 2, died in
OL,4,ACyprus hotel fall
OL,5,
OL,6,FA father whose two-year-old boy fell to
OL,7,Fhis death at a five-star hotel in
OL,8,FCyprus has been fined 3,000 euro
OL,9,F(#2,500).
OL,11,FJoshua Foster thought the window was
OL,12,Fclosed when he placed his son on a sill
OL,13,Fto show him the view of a waterpark and
OL,14,F"lost control" of him, Paphos District
OL,15,FCourt previously heard.
OL,17,FThe toddler fell nearly 40ft (12.1m)
OL,18,Ffrom the fourth floor of the King
OL,19,FEvelthon Beach Hotel and Resort on 12
OL,20,FJuly, the first day of the family's
OL,21,Fholiday in Chlorakas.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
