OL,3,GNEWSADad fined after son, 2, died in
OL,4,ACyprus hotel fall
OL,5,
OL,6,FFoster, 37, from Essex, admitted
OL,7,Fcausing death through a reckless, rash
OL,8,For dangerous act and was sentenced on
OL,9,FFriday morning.
